The bounded binding contains only the selected provider's fields; reject mixed provider fields. Fetch and validate the exact current binding before every operation. Drive reads use exact mapped raw IDs/MIME. GitHub reads pin the full canonical ref and use its exact commit/tree/blobs; writes require the observed Git-object and non-force ref-update capability profile, with readback and lost-response recovery. The standard ChatGPT GitHub app is read-only and cannot satisfy that writer gate. Never search or fall back to another similarly named instance or provider, mirror writes, or automatically fail over. Use only the required pinned workflow reference. Related questions are wiki-first and disclose freshness/support/gaps; current verification also checks external evidence. Persist only explicit save/add/track/investigate intent. Return an observed `SAVED`, `QUEUED`, `ACCEPTED_PENDING_MERGE`, `BLOCKED`, or `PARTIAL` receipt.

